{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:56:05+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T16:56:05+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Ørsted A/S","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Renewable","country":"Denmark","city":"Fredericia","website":"https://orsted.com","employees":7151,"summary":"Ørsted A/S, together with its subsidiaries, owns, develops, constructs, and operates offshore and onshore wind farms, solar farms, and energy storage and combined heat and power (CHP) plants. It operates through Offshore, Onshore, and Bioenergy & Other segments. The Offshore segment owns, develops, constructs, and operates offshore wind farms in Europe, the United States, and the Asia-Pacific region. The Onshore segment owns, develops, constructs, and operates onshore wind and solar farms in the United States, including integrated storage. The Bioenergy & Other segment generates heat and power and offers ancillary services from CHP plants in Denmark; and optimizes its gas portfolio, as well as manages its Danish and Swedish B2B business. The company was formerly known as DONG Energy A/S and changed its name to Ørsted A/S in November 2017. Ørsted A/S was incorporated in 1972 and is based in Fredericia, Denmark.","exchange":"Copenhagen","currency":"DKK","financial_currency":"DKK","summary_fr":"rsted A/S, avec ses filiales, possède, développe, construit et exploite des parcs éoliens offshore et onshore, des parcs solaires et des centrales de stockage d'énergie et de production combinée de chaleur et d'électricité (CHP). Elle opère à travers les segments Offshore, Onshore et Bioenergy & Other. Le segment Offshore possède, développe, construit et exploite des parcs éoliens offshore en Europe, aux États-Unis et dans la région Asie-Pacifique."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":189506338816,"shares_outstanding":1321062000,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":15.120644,"price_to_book":1.584295